<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίληψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grasping with the hand</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.98
			</span></i> ; <i>embracing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>comprehension</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ π. τῆς
				ἀρχῆς τῆς ψυχικῆς</span> in <i>the fact of their
				comprehending</i> the vital principle, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				762a25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.16U.
			</span></i>(pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστημονικὴ π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				p.276
			</span></i> C.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς καθολικὴν καὶ ἔντεχνον π.
				πεσεῖν</span> admit of general and technical
				<i>comprehension</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>inclusion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ περίληψιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					10.99
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				286
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Euc.</u>
				p.395
			</span></i> F. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> concrete,
				<i>that which includes</i> or <i>comprehends</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς] πάντων π. καὶ μέτρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.8.18
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἡνωμένη π. η&lt;&gt;ν
				σπέρμα πάντων ἐκάλεσε</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				98
			</span></i>.</div>
